@page "/astro-facts/{Id:int}"
@implements IDisposable
@using System.Globalization
@using Ikiastrro.Web.Components.Workspace
@using Ikiastrro.Web.Components.LifeMatters
@inject BirthDetailsRepository BirthDetailsRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.Statistics.LifeMatterPromiseService PromiseService
@inject ChartResultsRepository ChartResultsRepo
@inject ChartKeyDetailsRepository ChartKeyDetailsRepo
@inject ChartHouseLordsRepository ChartHouseLordsRepo
@inject ChartHouseLordInterpretationRepository ChartHouseLordInterpretationRepo
@inject ChartAspectsRepository ChartAspectsRepo
@inject ChartMoonContextRepository ChartMoonContextRepo
@inject ChartConjunctionsRepository ChartConjunctionsRepo
@inject ChartMultiGrahaConjunctionRepository ChartMultiGrahaConjunctionRepo
@inject ChartTypeRepository ChartTypeRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.GocharaRepository Gochara
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.Natal_Transit_Comp_WheelRepository D1WheelRepo
@inject DashaPeriodsRepository DashaRepo
@inject SadeSatiRepository SadeSatiRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.PlanetaryStrengthRepository PlanetaryStrengthRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.BhavaStrengthRepository BhavaStrengthRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.AshtakavargaRepository AshtakavargaRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.AmsabalaRepository AmsabalaRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.AmsabalaSchemeRepository AmsabalaSchemeRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.TransitStrengthRuleRepository TransitStrengthRuleRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.BeneficMaleficSchoolRepository BeneficMaleficRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.VargottamaRepository VargottamaRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.YogaEvaluationRepository YogaEvaluationRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.InterpretationRepository InterpretationRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.ArgalaRuleRepository ArgalaRuleRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.NaisargikaKarakaRepository NaisargikaRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.ArgalaFactRepository ArgalaFactRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.RasiNakshatraCombinationRepository RasiNakshatraCombinationRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.NakshatraReferenceRepository NakshatraReferenceRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.GrahaDrishtiStrengthRepository GrahaDrishtiStrengthRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.PlanetaryStateRepository PlanetaryStateRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.PlanetaryStateRuleRepository PlanetaryStateRuleRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.PostureStateInterpretationRepository PostureStateInterpretationRepo
@inject Ikiastrro.Data.PanchangaRepository PanchangaRepo
@inject LifeMatterReferenceRepository LifeMatterReferenceRepo
@inject LifeMatterFocusRepository LifeMatterFocusRepo
@inject ActivePerson Active
@inject Microsoft.JSInterop.IJSRuntime JS

@* Astro Facts — docs/ui/components/astro-facts.md. Steps 1–4 built (3.4 Amsabala added
   2026-09-16), 5 (Yogas) and 6 (Vargas) added 2026-09-16; 7 (All Charts) embedded as its own
   master tab 2026-09-24 (rammyps's directive — no more jumping to a separate page for it) via
   the shared `AllChartsGrid` component (Components/Charts/**), which also backs the standalone
   /charts/{id} page (AllCharts.razor) — both render off the same already-loaded WorkspaceData,
   so this tab needs no extra query. Same South-Indian grid component
   as /charts (Codex `SindUniDtlGrid`, re-skinned via token overrides only, not
   modified) for the "1.1 D1 - BIRTH CHART" tab, chart left / table right (`.ki-d1layout`,
   2026-09-23). D1's table is back to `PlanetPositionsTable` (`Variant="d1"`, `ShowAnalysis=
   false` — position only here, 2.2/"1.2 About Planets" owns role/condition) as of 2026-09-23
   evening (rammyps's call — the transposed planets-as-columns layout tried earlier that day was
   reverted for being harder to read; the plain planets-as-rows table is easier). The transposed
   `PlanetPositionsD1Transposed` component (with its Nak Pada Lord column, read off the person's
   own D9) still exists but is unused now — VargaView is PlanetPositionsTable's only other
   caller, passing `Variant="varga"`. The standalone /transit-wheel page has
   been folded into the "1.2 TRANSIT CHART" tab wholesale — wheel chart, date/dasha selector,
   and Gochara table — reusing its
   Natal_Transit_Comp_WheelRepository/TransitSelection/Natal_Transit_Comp_WheelMath exactly;
   only the chart shown under a tab now, not a separate route.

   Three tab levels, rebuilt 2026-09-23 evening (rammyps's directive) as plain hand-rolled pill
   navs — `<button role="tab">` + a private `int` field per level (`_masterTab`/`_activeTab`/
   `_strengthTab`), no `<MudTabs>` — after three separate rounds earlier in the project of
   fighting MudTabs' internal DOM just to make it look like a plain pill; the app's own header
   nav (`.ik-headtab`, MainLayout.razor.css) already proved the plain-markup version of this
   look works, so the tab strip here now follows it directly. See design-language.md "Tabs" for
   the full history and the shared `--tab-*` tokens (sunset-fill/navy-text pill, same for active
   and inactive — the only difference is `aria-selected`).
   Master rail (7 steps: "1. NATAL CHARTS" .. "7. ALL CHARTS", labels as two stacked `<span>`s
   each rather than one wrapped string — `MasterSteps`/`MasterNav` in `@code` below) doesn't
   render in this page's own body at all: it's handed to `Active.SetHeaderExtra` (see
   `OnParametersSet`) and rendered by `MainLayout` inside the shared person band, to the right
   of the name, so the tab row no longer costs its own line of vertical space. Because that
   `<nav>`'s markup physically renders inside MainLayout's tree, `SelectMaster` calls
   `StateHasChanged()` explicitly after changing `_masterTab` — see that method's own comment.
   Per-panel heading text (D1-TRANSIT/ABOUT/STRENGTH, plus the "Step N of 6" stepnum line) was
   dropped from every panel 2026-09-16/09-17, rammyps's call — the tab pill above already names
   the step, so panels open straight into their content; `.ki-panelbody` carries a flat top
   margin for the breathing room that heading used to provide. "4. SPL LAGNAS" never had a
   heading of its own beyond the embedded KarakaPolarWheel's own header.
   Where a step has sub-views, its own inner plain nav (same `.ki-steptab`/`.ki-steptab-sub`
   pill, physically in the page body this time, not the band, single line at this level too as
   of 2026-09-24 — see that class's own comment in the .css file): Natal Charts uses a
   D1-default chart selector and 1.1 GENERAL / 1.2 ABOUT PLANETS / 1.3 ABOUT HOUSES & SIGN &
   PLANET ASPECTS (_activeTab, reduced from 4 sub-tabs to 3 on 2026-09-24, rammyps's call — the
   old 1.3 About Houses and 1.4 Aspected (%) panels are now one merged panel, House
   lordship/Argala followed by Graha/Rāśi Dṛṣṭi/dispositors/conjunctions in one scroll). Moon
   context (`LunarPhaseCard`) was pulled back out of the chart view the same day — no longer
   sticky across every sub-tab — and now sits at the top of 1.2 About Planets, alongside the
   rest of a planet's condition; "Birth Pañchāṅga" (`PanchangaCard`) stays at the top of
   1.1 General, where it always was. Both cards render on the app's new dark "card" surface
   (`--card-*` tokens in tokens.css) instead of the page's light parchment, so each reads as its
   own distinct fact card rather than blending into the section beneath it — each is a
   self-contained card shell now (no shared wrapper), so either can be reused standalone
   elsewhere later. Strength's is 3.1 PLANET STRENGTH/3.2 HOUSE STRENGTH/3.3 ASHTAKAVARGA. Every
   tab text at every level is ALL CAPS.
   2.2's exaltation-closeness bar + table read ChartViewModel.BuildExaltationRows (Core) over
   lc.KeyDetails; the Moon-context facts read ChartMoonContextRepository (vw_ChartMoonContext)
   separately, same "outside WorkspaceData" pattern as the Current Transit tab's Gochara/Dasha
   loads — only this page needs it. 3.1/3.2 (`PlanetStrengthChart`/`HouseStrengthChart`, own
   `.razor.css`) read PlanetaryStrengthRepository/BhavaStrengthRepository's new
   GetSummaryByBirthDetailId/GetComponentsByBirthDetailId over vw_ChartShadbala/
   vw_ChartBhavaBala + the two component fact tables — same "outside WorkspaceData" pattern,
   loaded alongside Moon context/Gochara/Dasha in OnParametersSet.
   5 (`YogaEvaluationTable`) reads YogaEvaluationRepository over vw_ChartYogaEvaluations
   (db/053+079) — the typed read model built for this step, evaluation itself already runs in
   ChartGenerationService.PersistAnalytics.

   6 (`AmsabalaTable`, 2026-09-16 redesign, superseding both the original flat `VargaLordsTable`
   and the standalone "3.4 Amsabala" Strength sub-tab): one scheme-tabbed view —
   Vargottama/Shadvarga/Saptavarga/Dasavarga/Shodasavarga — instead of two different depths of
   the same varga breakdown living in two different steps. Vargottama is unchanged (D1/D9/Match).
   Each scheme's graha row is collapsed to just its numeric split (GoodCount/GroupSize + %) by
   default; expanding it reveals the stacked dignity bar (now full 7-tier —
   Exalted/Moolatrikona/Own/Great Friend/Friend/Enemy/Great Enemy via
   `ChartViewModel.DignityTierToken`, not the old binary good/not-good) and a varga-lords detail
   table underneath (Varga/Sign/Lord/Dignity/0-1 score via `ChartViewModel
   .DignityScoreNormalized` — for later statistical use, docs/research/domain/stat_strength.md).
   Still needs no new repository beyond what 3.4 already injected
   (`AmsabalaRepo`/`AmsabalaSchemeRepo`/`VargottamaRepo`) — the lords/dignity data reads straight
   off `_data.Charts` (every persisted varga's Grahas + HouseLords, already loaded by
   WorkspaceData.Load for every chart type), same as the old `VargaLordsTable`/AllCharts.razor's
   grid. A "3.4"/"amsabala" deep link now routes to step 6 (`_masterTab = 5`) instead of a Strength
   sub-tab that no longer exists. *@

@if (PrintModules is null)
{
    <PageTitle>Astro Facts — @(_data?.Person.Name ?? "Chart") — ikiastrro</PageTitle>
}

@if (_data is null)
{
    <section class="ki-unavailable" role="status">
        <h1 class="ki-heading">ASTRO FACTS</h1>
        <p>D1 is not computed for this person.</p>
        <a href="/">Choose a saved person</a>
    </section>
}
else
{
    var lc = _data.Charts["D1"];

    @GroupNav

    @if (Shows(0))
    {
        <div class="ki-panelbody" id="ki-panel-0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-tab-0">
            @PrintHead(0)
                @if (NatalChart is { } natalChart)
                {
                    <div class="ki-natal-layout @(_natalChartCollapsed ? "is-chart-collapsed" : null)">
                        <div class="ki-gridwrap">
                            <div class="ki-chart-toolbar">
                                <button type="button" class="ki-chart-toggle" aria-expanded="@(!_natalChartCollapsed)" @onclick="() => _natalChartCollapsed = !_natalChartCollapsed">
                                    @(_natalChartCollapsed ? "EXPAND CHART" : "COLLAPSE CHART")
                                </button>
                                <select class="ki-chart-picker" aria-label="Natal chart" value="@_natalChart" @onchange="OnNatalChartChanged">
                                    @foreach (var chart in NatalChartOptions)
                                    {
                                        <option value="@chart.ChartType">@chart.Label</option>
                                    }
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            @if (!_natalChartCollapsed)
                            {
                                <SindUniDtlGrid AscendantSign="@natalChart.AscendantSign" MoonSign="@natalChart.MoonSign" PlanetsBySign="PlanetsBySign(natalChart)" CenterTitle="@natalChart.ChartType"
                                                 HighlightSign="@LinkedPoint?.Sign" HighlightLabel="@LinkedPoint?.Label">
                                    <CenterMeta><b>Lagna</b> @Disp(natalChart.AscendantSign)</CenterMeta>
                                </SindUniDtlGrid>
                            }
                        </div>
                        <div class="ki-natal-detail ki-subnav-wrap">
                        <nav class="ki-subnav" role="tablist" aria-label="Natal chart details">
                            <button type="button" role="tab" id="ki-natal-tab-0" aria-selected="@(_activeTab == 0)" aria-controls="ki-natal-panel-0" class="ki-steptab ki-steptab-sub" @onclick="() => _activeTab = 0">GENERAL</button>
                            <button type="button" role="tab" id="ki-natal-tab-1" aria-selected="@(_activeTab == 1)" aria-controls="ki-natal-panel-1" class="ki-steptab ki-steptab-sub" @onclick="() => _activeTab = 1">ABOUT PLANETS</button>
                            <button type="button" role="tab" id="ki-natal-tab-2" aria-selected="@(_activeTab == 2)" aria-controls="ki-natal-panel-2" class="ki-steptab ki-steptab-sub" @onclick="() => _activeTab = 2">ABOUT HOUSES</button>
                            <button type="button" role="tab" id="ki-natal-tab-3" aria-selected="@(_activeTab == 3)" aria-controls="ki-natal-panel-3" class="ki-steptab ki-steptab-sub" @onclick="() => _activeTab = 3">SIGNS &amp; PLANET ASPECTS</button>
                            <button type="button" role="tab" id="ki-natal-tab-4" aria-selected="@(_activeTab == 4)" aria-controls="ki-natal-panel-4" class="ki-steptab ki-steptab-sub" @onclick="() => _activeTab = 4">SPECIAL POINTS</button>
                        </nav>
                        <div class="ki-subpanels">
                            @if (SubShows(_activeTab, 0))
                            {
                                <div id="ki-natal-panel-0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-natal-tab-0">
                    @SubHead("General")
                    @Head(NatalSection.Panchanga)
                    <PanchangaCard Row="_panchanga" UtcOffset="_utcOffset" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.Positions)
                    <PlanetPositionsTable Rows="Rows(natalChart)" LagnaSign="@natalChart.AscendantSign" Variant="d1" ShowAnalysis="false"
                                           States="_planetaryStates" StateNames="_stateNames" PostureInterpretations="_postureInterpretations" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.SignNakshatra)
                    <RasiNakshatraTable Grahas="natalChart.Grahas" Combinations="_rasiNakshatraCombinations" />
                                </div>
                            }
                            @if (SubShows(_activeTab, 4))
                            {
                                <div id="ki-natal-panel-4" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-natal-tab-4">
                    <CascadingValue Value="_pointLink" IsFixed="true">
                    @SubHead("Special points")
                    @JumpNav(NatalSection.SpecialPointsTab)
                    @Head(NatalSection.Upagrahas)
                    <SpecialPointsTable Rows="@(Points(natalChart, "Upagraha"))" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.ArudhaPadas)
                    <SpecialPointsTable Rows="@(Points(natalChart, "Arudha"))" ShowDegree="false" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.GrahaArudhas)
                    <SpecialPointsTable Rows="@(Points(natalChart, "GrahaArudha"))" ShowDegree="false" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.Yogi)
                    <SensitivePointsTable KeyDetails="D1KeyDetails" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.NavaTara)
                    <NavaTaraTable KeyDetails="D1KeyDetails" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.SpecialTara)
                    <SpecialTaraTable KeyDetails="D1KeyDetails" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.Latta)
                    <LattaTable KeyDetails="D1KeyDetails" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.SpecialTithis)
                    <SpecialTithiTable KeyDetails="D1KeyDetails" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.Sphutas)
                    <SphutaTable KeyDetails="D1KeyDetails" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.Sahams)
                    <SahamsTable KeyDetails="D1KeyDetails" IsNightBirth="@(_panchanga?.IsNightBirth ?? false)" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.Malicious)
                    <MaliciousDivisionsTable KeyDetails="D1KeyDetails" />
                    </CascadingValue>
                                </div>
                            }
                            @if (SubShows(_activeTab, 1))
                            {
                                <div id="ki-natal-panel-1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-natal-tab-1">
                    @SubHead("About planets")
                    @JumpNav(NatalSection.AboutPlanetsTab)
                    @Head(NatalSection.Moon)
                    @if (_moon is null)
                    {
                        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Dense="true" Class="ki-alert">
                            Moon context not available for this chart yet — run <code>recompute-keydetails</code>.
                        </MudAlert>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <LunarPhaseCard Moon="_moon" PakshaBalaVirupas="MoonPakshaBala" />
                    }
                    <MoonNakshatraAttributes Nakshatra="MoonNakshatra" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.Dignity)
                    <PlanetDignityTable Rows="ExaltationRows(natalChart)" LagnaSign="@natalChart.AscendantSign" MoonWaxing="MoonPhase.Of(natalChart.Grahas)" />
                    @if (!Printing) { <PlainWords Lines="DignityLines(natalChart)" Title="Dignity in plain words" /> }

                    @Head(NatalSection.BeneficMalefic)
                    <PlanetBeneficMaleficTable Chart="natalChart" Charts="_data.Charts" Rules="_beneficMaleficRules" MoonWaxing="MoonPhase.Of(natalChart.Grahas)" DashaPeriods="_dashaTree" AsOf="DateTime.Today" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.Motion)
                    <PlanetMotionTable KeyDetails="D1KeyDetails" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.MrityuPushkara)
                    <MrityuPushkaraTable KeyDetails="D1KeyDetails" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.RudraMaheswara)
                    <RudraMaheswaraTable KeyDetails="D1KeyDetails" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.States)
                    <PlanetaryStateTable Rows="_planetaryStates" StateNames="_stateNames"
                                           PostureInterpretations="_postureInterpretations"
                                           KeyDetails="D1KeyDetails" Strengths="_shadbala" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.Sayanadi)
                    <SayanadiWorkingTable KeyDetails="D1KeyDetails" JanmaGhatis="_panchanga?.JanmaGhatis" StateNames="_stateNames" />
                                </div>
                            }
                            @if (SubShows(_activeTab, 2))
                            {
                                <div id="ki-natal-panel-2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-natal-tab-2">
                    @SubHead("About houses")
                    @JumpNav(NatalSection.AboutHousesTab)
                    @Head(NatalSection.HouseLords)
                    <HouseLordshipTable Rows="natalChart.HouseLords" Occupants="Occupants(natalChart)"
                                        LifeMatters="_houseMatters" PersonId="Id" ChartType="@natalChart.ChartType"
                                        CoLords="CoLordsOf(natalChart)" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.HouseFindings)
                    <HouseLordFindingsTable Rows="natalChart.HouseLordInterpretations" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.HouseVerdicts)
                    <HouseVerdictTable Rows="ArgalaFacts.HouseVerdicts(natalChart.AscendantSign, natalChart.Grahas, ArgalaFacts.ForChart(_argalaFacts, natalChart.ChartType, natalChart.AscendantSign, natalChart.Grahas))" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.Argala)
                    <ArgalaTable Facts="ArgalaFacts.ForChart(_argalaFacts, natalChart.ChartType, natalChart.AscendantSign, natalChart.Grahas)" Grahas="natalChart.Grahas" AscendantSign="@natalChart.AscendantSign" SignificanceNotes="_argalaSignificanceNotes" HouseMatters="_argalaHouseMatters" />

                    @Head(NatalSection.StrongerRasi)
                    <StrongerRasiTable Chart="natalChart" />
                                </div>
                            }
                            @if (SubShows(_activeTab, 3))
                            {
                                <div id="ki-natal-panel-3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-natal-tab-3">
                    @SubHead("Signs & planet aspects")
                    @JumpNav(NatalSection.SignsAspectsTab)
                    @Head(NatalSection.GrahaDrishti)
                    <GrahaDrishtiMatrix Rows="_grahaDrishtiStrengths" SelectedChart="@_natalChart" />

                    @if (NatalChart is { } relationshipChart)
                    {
                        @Head(NatalSection.RasiDrishti)
                        <RasiDrishtiMatrix KeyDetails="relationshipChart.KeyDetails" />

                        @Head(NatalSection.Dispositors)
                        <DispositorTable ChartType="@relationshipChart.ChartType" AscendantSign="@relationshipChart.AscendantSign" KeyDetails="relationshipChart.KeyDetails" />
                        <DispositorSummaryPanel ChartType="@relationshipChart.ChartType" AscendantSign="@relationshipChart.AscendantSign" KeyDetails="relationshipChart.KeyDetails" HouseLords="relationshipChart.HouseLords" Shadbala="_shadbala" />

                        @Head(NatalSection.Conjunctions)
                        <HouseConjunctionsTable Groups="relationshipChart.MultiGrahaConjunctions" KeyDetails="relationshipChart.KeyDetails" />
                    }
                                </div>
                            }
                        </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                }
        </div>
    }

    @if (Shows(1))
    {
        <div class="ki-panelbody" id="ki-panel-1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-tab-1">
            @PrintHead(1)
                    <div class="ki-wheelwrap">
                    <div class="ki-viewswitch ki-viewswitch-corner" role="group" aria-label="Chart style">
                        <button type="button" aria-pressed="@(!_showSudarsana)" @onclick="() => _showSudarsana = false">Polar wheel</button>
                        <button type="button" aria-pressed="@_showSudarsana" @onclick="() => _showSudarsana = true">Sudarsana chakra</button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="ki-wheel">
                        @if (_d1.Count > 0 && _showSudarsana)
                        {
                            <SudarsanaChakra AscendantSign="@lc.AscendantSign" Planets="@SudarsanaPlanets"
                                             MahaLord="@_selection?.Maha?.Lord" AntarLord="@_selection?.Antar?.Lord"
                                             PratyantarLord="@_selection?.Pratyantar?.Lord" />
                        }
                        else if (_d1.Count > 0)
                        {
                            <Natal_Transit_Comp_WheelChart AscendantSign="@lc.AscendantSign"
                                               NatalPoints="@D1WheelPoints"
                                               TransitPoints="@TransitWheelPoints"
                                               NatalMoonSign="@_natalSignByPlanet.GetValueOrDefault("Moon")"
                                               AsOfUtc="@_asOfUtc" />
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Dense="true" Class="ki-alert">
                                Generate a D1 chart for this person first.
                            </MudAlert>
                        }
                    </div>
                    </div>

                    @* Date + dasha selector sits under the wheel so the wheel fills the top of the viewport. *@
                    @if (_selection is not null)
                    {
                        <section class="ki-controls" aria-label="Transit date and dasha filters">
                            <label class="ki-field">
                                <span>TRANSIT</span>
                                <span class="ki-monthyear">
                                    <select value="@SelMonth" @onchange="OnMonthChanged">
                                        @for (var m = 1; m <= 12; m++)
                                        {
                                            <option value="@m">@m.ToString("00")</option>
                                        }
                                    </select>
                                    <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
                                    <select value="@SelYear" @onchange="OnYearChanged">
                                        @foreach (var y in YearOptions)
                                        {
                                            <option value="@y">@y</option>
                                        }
                                    </select>
                                </span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="ki-field">
                                <span>MAHADASHA</span>
                                <select value="@(_selection.Maha?.Id.ToString() ?? string.Empty)" @onchange="OnMahaChanged">
                                    <option value="">Select Mahadasha</option>
                                    @foreach (var period in _selection.Periods)
                                    {
                                        <option value="@period.Id">@PlanetGlyph(period.Lord) @period.Lord · @PeriodDates(period)</option>
                                    }
                                </select>
                                @SpanCaption(_selection.Maha)
                            </label>
                            <label class="ki-field">
                                <span>ANTARDASHA</span>
                                <select value="@(_selection.Antar?.Id.ToString() ?? string.Empty)" @onchange="OnAntarChanged" disabled="@(_selection.Maha is null)">
                                    <option value="">Select Antardasha</option>
                                    @foreach (var period in _selection.AntarPeriods)
                                    {
                                        <option value="@period.Id">@PlanetGlyph(period.Lord) @period.Lord · @PeriodDates(period)</option>
                                    }
                                </select>
                                @SpanCaption(_selection.Antar)
                            </label>
                            <label class="ki-field">
                                <span>PRATYANTAR</span>
                                <select value="@(_selection.Pratyantar?.Id.ToString() ?? string.Empty)" @onchange="OnPratyantarChanged" disabled="@(_selection.Antar is null)">
                                    <option value="">Select Pratyantar</option>
                                    @foreach (var period in _selection.PratyantarPeriods)
                                    {
                                        <option value="@period.Id">@PlanetGlyph(period.Lord) @period.Lord · @PeriodDates(period)</option>
                                    }
                                </select>
                                @SpanCaption(_selection.Pratyantar)
                            </label>
                            @for (var lv = 0; lv < DeepNames.Length; lv++)
                            {
                                var idx = lv;
                                var above = idx == 0 ? _selection.Pratyantar : _selection.Deep(idx - 1);
                                <label class="ki-field">
                                    <span>@DeepNames[idx]</span>
                                    <select value="@(_selection.Deep(idx)?.Id.ToString() ?? string.Empty)" @onchange="e => OnDeepChanged(idx, e)" disabled="@(above is null)">
                                        <option value="">Select @DeepNames[idx].ToLowerInvariant()</option>
                                        @foreach (var period in _selection.DeepPeriods(idx))
                                        {
                                            <option value="@period.Id">@PlanetGlyph(period.Lord) @period.Lord · @PeriodDates(period)</option>
                                        }
                                    </select>
                                    @SpanCaption(_selection.Deep(idx))
                                </label>
                            }
                        </section>
                    }

                    @if (_transitError is not null || _transits.Count == 0)
                    {
                        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Dense="true" Class="ki-alert">
                            Transit reference not backfilled — run <code>backfill-planet-transits</code>.
                        </MudAlert>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <div class="ki-scroll">
                            <MudSimpleTable Dense="true" Hover="false" Bordered="false" Class="ki-table">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr class="ki-colgroup">
                                        <th></th><th colspan="4" class="ki-group-natal">NATAL (D1)</th><th colspan="10" class="ki-group-transit">TRANSIT</th>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th>Planet</th>
                                        <th class="ki-group-natal">Natal<br />position</th><th class="ki-group-natal">Nakshatra<br />pada</th>
                                        <th class="ki-group-natal">Natal<br />house</th><th class="ki-group-natal">Dignity</th>
                                        <th>Planet in<br />Natal House</th><th>House from<br />Natal Planet</th>
                                        <th>Motion</th><th>Degree</th>
                                        <th>Speed<br />°/day</th><th>In sign<br />since</th>
                                        <th>In-sign<br />motion</th><th>Next<br />change</th><th>Next-change<br />motion</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    @foreach (var s in TransitRows)
                                    {
                                        var natal = NatalRow(s);
                                        <tr>
                                            <td>@s.Planet</td>
                                            <td class="num ki-group-natal">@(natal is null ? "—" : $"{SignAbbrev(natal.Sign)} {natal.DegreesInSignDisplay}{(natal.IsRetrograde ? " R" : "")}")</td>
                                            <td class="ki-group-natal">@(natal?.Nakshatra is { } nak ? $"{nak} {natal.NakshatraPada}" : "—")</td>
                                            <td class="num ki-group-natal">@(natal?.House?.ToString() ?? "—")</td>
                                            <td class="ki-group-natal">@(natal?.DignityStatus ?? "—")</td>
                                            <td class="num">@(PlanetInNatalHouse(s)?.ToString() ?? "—")</td>
                                            <td class="num">@(HouseFromNatalPlanet(s)?.ToString() ?? "—")</td>
                                            <td>@s.MotionDirection</td>
                                            <td class="num">@SignName(s.SignId) @s.DegreeInSign.ToString("0.00", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)°</td>
                                            <td class="num">@s.SpeedDegreesPerDay.ToString("0.0000", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)</td>
                                            <td class="num">@s.InSignSinceUtc.ToString("dd MMM yyyy", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)</td>
                                            <td>@(s.InSignMotion ?? "—")</td>
                                            <td class="num">@(s.NextChangeUtc?.ToString("dd MMM yyyy", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) ?? "—")</td>
                                            <td>@(s.NextChangeMotion ?? "—")</td>
                                        </tr>
                                    }
                                </tbody>
                            </MudSimpleTable>
                        </div>
                        @if (GocharaJudgement is { } gochara)
                        {
                            <GocharaInferencePanel Inference="GocharaInferenceOf(gochara)" MoonSign="@_natalSignByPlanet.GetValueOrDefault("Moon")" />
                            <GocharaTable Reading="gochara" />
                        }
                    }
                    @if (_d1.Count > 0)
                    {
                        <SaturnFromMoonPanel Periods="_sadeSati"
                                             BirthDate="_data.Person.DateOfBirth.ToDateTime(_data.Person.EffectiveTimeOfBirth)"
                                             AsOf="@(_selection?.ActiveIst ?? _asOfUtc)"
                                             Phase="SaturnPhaseOnDate"
                                             MoonSign="@_natalSignByPlanet.GetValueOrDefault("Moon")" />
                    }
        </div>
    }

    @if (Shows(2))
    {
        <div class="ki-panelbody" id="ki-panel-2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-tab-2">
            @PrintHead(2)
          <div class="ki-natal-layout @(_natalChartCollapsed ? "is-chart-collapsed" : null)">
            @ChartColumn
            <div class="ki-natal-detail">
            <div class="ki-subnav-wrap">
            <nav class="ki-subnav" role="tablist" aria-label="Strength details">
                <button type="button" role="tab" id="ki-strength-tab-0" aria-selected="@(_strengthTab == 0)" aria-controls="ki-strength-panel-0" class="ki-steptab ki-steptab-sub" @onclick="() => _strengthTab = 0">PLANET STRENGTH</button>
                <button type="button" role="tab" id="ki-strength-tab-1" aria-selected="@(_strengthTab == 1)" aria-controls="ki-strength-panel-1" class="ki-steptab ki-steptab-sub" @onclick="() => _strengthTab = 1">HOUSE STRENGTH</button>
                <button type="button" role="tab" id="ki-strength-tab-2" aria-selected="@(_strengthTab == 2)" aria-controls="ki-strength-panel-2" class="ki-steptab ki-steptab-sub" @onclick="() => _strengthTab = 2">ASHTAVARGA</button>
            </nav>
            <div class="ki-subpanels">
                @if (SubShows(_strengthTab, 0))
                {
                    <div id="ki-strength-panel-0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-strength-tab-0">
                    @SubHead("Planet strength")
                    @Guide("strength-planet")
                    @if (_shadbala.Count == 0)
                    {
                        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Dense="true" Class="ki-alert">
                            Shadbala not computed for this person yet — run <code>recompute-strength</code>.
                        </MudAlert>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <PlanetStrengthChart Rows="_shadbala" Components="_shadbalaComponents" />
                        @if (!Printing) { <PlainWords Lines="PlanetStrengthLines()" Title="Planet strength in plain words" /> }
                    }
                    </div>
                }

                @if (SubShows(_strengthTab, 1))
                {
                    <div id="ki-strength-panel-1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-strength-tab-1">
                    @SubHead("House strength")
                    @Guide("strength-house")
                    @if (_bhavaBala.Count == 0)
                    {
                        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Dense="true" Class="ki-alert">
                            Bhava Bala not computed for this person yet — run <code>recompute-strength</code>.
                        </MudAlert>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <HouseStrengthChart Rows="_bhavaBala" Components="_bhavaBalaComponents" />
                        @if (!Printing) { <PlainWords Lines="HouseStrengthLines()" Title="House strength in plain words" /> }
                    }
                    </div>
                }

                @if (SubShows(_strengthTab, 2))
                {
                    <div id="ki-strength-panel-2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-strength-tab-2">
                    @SubHead("Ashtavarga")
                    @Guide("strength-ashtavarga")
                    @if (_ashtakavarga.Count == 0)
                    {
                        <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Dense="true" Class="ki-alert">
                            Ashtavarga has not been computed for these charts yet — recalculate the saved chart.
                        </MudAlert>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <AshtakavargaChart Rows="_ashtakavarga" PindaRows="_ashtakavargaPinda" Charts="_data.Charts" @bind-SelectedChart="_natalChart" />
                    }
                    </div>
                }
            </div>
            </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
    }

    @if (Shows(3))
    {
        <div class="ki-panelbody" id="ki-panel-3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-tab-3">
            @PrintHead(3)
            @Guide("karakas")
            <KarakaPolarWheel Id="@Id" Embedded="true" IsNightBirth="@(_panchanga?.IsNightBirth ?? false)" />
        </div>
    }

    @if (Shows(4))
    {
        @* No chart column here (rammyps, 2026-10-02): yogas are read off the whole chart set, so the
           D1 grid and chart picker added nothing. *@
        <div class="ki-panelbody" id="ki-panel-4" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-tab-4">
            @PrintHead(4)
            @Guide("yogas")
            <div class="ki-stephead">
                <h1 class="ki-heading">YOGAS</h1>
            </div>

            @if (_yogaEvaluations.Count == 0 && _yogaVarga == "D1")
            {
                <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Dense="true" Class="ki-alert">
                    Yogas have not been evaluated for this chart yet.
                </MudAlert>
            }
            else
            {
                <YogaEvaluationTable Rows="_yogaEvaluations" HouseLords="YogaHouseLords" Placements="YogaPlacements" Shadbala="_shadbala" Interpretations="_interpretations"
                                     Varga="@_yogaVarga" Vargas="Ikiastrro.Core.Engines.Yoga.ProductionYogaEngine.VargaReferenceCharts" OnVargaChanged="SelectYogaVarga"
                                     OnSaveInterpretation="SaveInterpretation" />
            }
        </div>
    }

    @if (Shows(5))
    {
        <div class="ki-panelbody" id="ki-panel-5" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-tab-5">
            @PrintHead(5)
            @Guide("vargas")
          <div class="ki-natal-layout @(_natalChartCollapsed ? "is-chart-collapsed" : null)">
            @ChartColumn
            <div class="ki-natal-detail">
            @if (_amsabala.Count == 0)
            {
                <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Dense="true" Class="ki-alert">
                    Vargas have not been computed for this chart yet.
                </MudAlert>
            }
            else
            {
                <AmsabalaTable Rows="_amsabala" Groups="_amsabalaGroups" Vargottama="_vargottama" Charts="_data.Charts" @bind-SelectedChart="_natalChart" @bind-Scheme="_vargaScheme" />
            }
            <VimsopakaTable Charts="_data.Charts" Weights="_vimsopakaWeights" Scheme="@_vargaScheme" />
            <VaiseshikamsaTable Charts="_data.Charts" />

            @Head(Shashtiamsa)
            <ShashtiamsaTable KeyDetails="D1KeyDetails" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
    }

    @if (Shows(6))
    {
        <div class="ki-panelbody" id="ki-panel-6" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-tab-6">
            @PrintHead(6)
            @Guide("all-charts")
            <h1 class="ki-heading">7. ALL CHARTS</h1>
            <AllChartsGrid Data="_data" />
        </div>
    }

    @if (Shows(7))
    {
        <div class="ki-panelbody" id="ki-panel-7" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-tab-7">
            @PrintHead(7)
            @Guide("d1-promise")
            <D1PromisePanel Readings="PromiseReadings" Error="_promiseError" />
        </div>
    }

    @if (Shows(8))
    {
        <div class="ki-panelbody" id="ki-panel-8" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-tab-8">
            @PrintHead(8)
            @Guide("phalita")
            <h1 class="ki-heading">9. PHALITA DASAS</h1>
            <PhalitaDasaPanel Chart="@(_data?.Charts.GetValueOrDefault("D1"))" Person="_data?.Person" Panchanga="_panchanga" />
        </div>
    }

    @if (Shows(9))
    {
        <div class="ki-panelbody" id="ki-panel-9" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ki-tab-9">
            @PrintHead(9)
            @Guide("dasha-matters")
            <h1 class="ki-heading">10. DASHA MATTERS</h1>
            <DashaMattersTable Charts="_data?.Charts" Periods="_dashaTree" />
        </div>
    }
}

@code {
    [Parameter] public int Id { get; set; }
    [Parameter, SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = "step")] public string? Step { get; set; }

    /// <summary>Opens the chart picker on this chart (e.g. <c>?step=houses&amp;chart=D9</c> — a Life
    /// Matters "full table" link, AstroFactsLink); ignored when the person has no such chart.</summary>
    [Parameter, SupplyParameterFromQuery(Name = "chart")] public string? Chart { get; set; }

    /// <summary>House number -> the life matters read from it; the About Houses table's links
    /// into Key Inference.</summary>
    private IReadOnlyDictionary<int, IReadOnlyList<HouseMatterLink>> _houseMatters = new Dictionary<int, IReadOnlyList<HouseMatterLink>>();

    /// <summary>PrintReport's module codes (PrintModules.AstroFacts). Set, the page renders every
    /// chosen master tab one after another, each sub-tab expanded under its own heading, with no
    /// rails; unset, it is the interactive page.</summary>
    [Parameter] public IReadOnlySet<string>? PrintModules { get; set; }
    private bool Printing => PrintModules is not null;

    private bool Shows(int master) => PrintModules is { } print
        ? print.Contains(Ikiastrro.Web.Components.Shared.PrintModules.AstroFacts[master].Code)
        : _masterTab == master;

    private bool SubShows(int current, int sub) => Printing || current == sub;

    private RenderFragment PrintHead(int master) => Printing
        ? @<h2 class="pr-modhead"><span>Astro Facts</span>@Ikiastrro.Web.Components.Shared.PrintModules.AstroFacts[master].Label</h2>
        : @<text></text>;

    private RenderFragment SubHead(string label) => Printing
        ? @<h3 class="pr-subhead">@label</h3>
        : @<text></text>;

    private int _masterTab;
    /// <summary>Natal sub-tab: 0 General, 1 About planets, 2 About houses,
    /// 3 Signs &amp; planet aspects, 4 Special points last (nav order; 4 was split out of General 2026-10-02, so the
    /// older indices and their ?step= links keep their meaning).</summary>
    private int _activeTab;
    private int _strengthTab;

    /// <summary>One section heading in a natal sub-tab. <see cref="D1Only"/> marks the tables read
    /// from the D1 rāśi chart whatever the chart picker shows; the rest follow the picker.</summary>
    private sealed record Section(string Id, string Title, bool D1Only = false);

    /// <summary>The natal sub-tabs' section headings, and the jump-link list of each sub-tab that
    /// has four or more (General's three need none).</summary>
    private static class NatalSection
    {
        public static readonly Section Panchanga = new("af-panchanga", "Birth Pañchāṅga");
        public static readonly Section Positions = new("af-positions", "Planet positions");
        public static readonly Section SignNakshatra = new("af-sign-nakshatra", "Sign & Nakshatra combination");

        public static readonly Section Upagrahas = new("af-upagrahas", "Upagrahas");
        public static readonly Section ArudhaPadas = new("af-arudha-padas", "Ārūḍha padas");
        public static readonly Section GrahaArudhas = new("af-graha-arudhas", "Graha ārūḍhas");
        public static readonly Section Yogi = new("af-yogi", "Yogi & sensitive points", D1Only: true);
        public static readonly Section NavaTara = new("af-nava-tara", "Nava tārā", D1Only: true);
        public static readonly Section SpecialTara = new("af-special-tara", "Special tārās", D1Only: true);
        public static readonly Section Latta = new("af-latta", "Lattā nakṣatras", D1Only: true);
        public static readonly Section SpecialTithis = new("af-special-tithis", "Special tithis", D1Only: true);
        public static readonly Section Sphutas = new("af-sphutas", "Sphuṭas", D1Only: true);
        public static readonly Section Sahams = new("af-sahams", "Sahams", D1Only: true);
        public static readonly Section Malicious = new("af-malicious", "64th navamsa & 22nd drekkana", D1Only: true);
        public static readonly Section[] SpecialPointsTab =
            [Upagrahas, ArudhaPadas, GrahaArudhas, Yogi, NavaTara, SpecialTara, Latta, SpecialTithis, Sphutas, Sahams, Malicious];

        public static readonly Section Moon = new("af-moon", "Moon context", D1Only: true);
        public static readonly Section Dignity = new("af-dignity", "Planets — dignity, kāraka, exaltation");
        public static readonly Section BeneficMalefic = new("af-benefic-malefic", "Benefic / malefic by school");
        public static readonly Section Motion = new("af-motion", "Motion, combustion & planetary war", D1Only: true);
        public static readonly Section MrityuPushkara = new("af-mrityu-pushkara", "Mrityu bhāga & Puṣkara", D1Only: true);
        public static readonly Section RudraMaheswara = new("af-rudra-maheswara", "Rudra, Trishoola & Maheswara", D1Only: true);
        public static readonly Section States = new("af-states", "Planet states (avasthas)", D1Only: true);
        public static readonly Section Sayanadi = new("af-sayanadi", "Śayanādi working", D1Only: true);
        public static readonly Section[] AboutPlanetsTab = [Moon, Dignity, BeneficMalefic, Motion, MrityuPushkara, RudraMaheswara, States, Sayanadi];

        public static readonly Section HouseLords = new("af-house-lords", "House lord placement");
        public static readonly Section HouseFindings = new("af-house-findings", "House lord key findings");
        public static readonly Section HouseVerdicts = new("af-house-verdicts", "What acts on each house");
        public static readonly Section Argala = new("af-argala", "Argala & Virodhargala");
        public static readonly Section StrongerRasi = new("af-stronger-rasi", "Stronger rasi & Narayana dasa seed");
        public static readonly Section[] AboutHousesTab = [HouseLords, HouseFindings, HouseVerdicts, Argala, StrongerRasi];

        public static readonly Section GrahaDrishti = new("af-graha-drishti", "Graha Dṛṣṭi strength");
        public static readonly Section RasiDrishti = new("af-rasi-drishti", "Rāśi Dṛṣṭi");
        public static readonly Section Dispositors = new("af-dispositors", "Rāśi & graha dispositors");
        public static readonly Section Conjunctions = new("af-conjunctions", "Conjunctions");
        public static readonly Section[] SignsAspectsTab = [GrahaDrishti, RasiDrishti, Dispositors, Conjunctions];
    }

    /// <summary>Vargas: each body's D60 part and deity, read from the D1 degree.</summary>
    private static readonly Section Shashtiamsa = new("af-shashtiamsa", "Ṣaṣṭyaṃśa (D60) deities", D1Only: true);

    /// <summary>A section heading. A D1-only section carries a "D1" tag, and while the picker
    /// shows another chart a note says the table did not follow it.</summary>
    private RenderFragment Head(Section section) => @<text><h3 class="ki-sectionhead" id="@section.Id" tabindex="-1">
        @section.Title
        @if (section.D1Only)
        {
            <span class="ki-d1tag" title="Read from the D1 rāśi chart, whichever chart the picker shows">D1</span>
            @if (_natalChart != "D1" && !Printing)
            {
                <span class="ki-d1note">always the rāśi chart — not the @_natalChart in the picker</span>
            }
        }
    </h3>@Guide(section.Id)</text>;

    private RenderFragment Guide(string key) => Printing ? @<text></text> : @<SectionGuide Key="@key" />;

    /// <summary>Jump links to a sub-tab's sections; not printed.</summary>
    private RenderFragment JumpNav(IReadOnlyList<Section> sections) => Printing
        ? @<text></text>
        : @<nav class="ki-jump" aria-label="Sections on this tab">
            @foreach (var section in sections)
            {
                var id = section.Id;
                <button type="button" class="ki-jumplink" @onclick="() => ScrollToSection(id)">@section.Title</button>
            }
        </nav>;

    private async Task ScrollToSection(string id) => await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("ikiastrroScroll.toSection", id);

    /// <summary>Master step rail — handed to <c>Active.SetHeaderExtra</c> (see
    /// <see cref="OnParametersSet"/>) so it renders inside MainLayout's context band, below the
    /// app bar (rammyps, 2026-09-23 evening: reclaim the vertical space the rail used to take
    /// as its own row in the page body). As of 2026-09-26 the band holds only this rail — the
    /// person name/birth line that used to share the row moved up into the app bar itself
    /// (MainLayout.razor's `.ik-appbar-person`), so the rail now simply fills the band's full
    /// width. Plain markup, not MudTabs — see docs/ui/design-language.md "Tabs" for why. Single
    /// line, no step numbers (rammyps's call, 2026-09-23 evening — the numbered two-line pills
    /// from earlier that day were dropped); labels shortened 2026-09-26 ("NATAL CHARTS"/
    /// "TRANSIT CHARTS" -> "NATAL"/"TRANSIT" — the rail reads as steps of one flow, not a list
    /// of noun phrases, so the repeated "CHARTS" was redundant with "ALL CHARTS" already
    /// present). The fragment's markup physically renders inside MainLayout's tree, but its
    /// <c>@onclick</c> handlers are bound to THIS page (Blazor ties an event callback to the
    /// component whose .razor file declares it), so a click re-renders only this page's body —
    /// never MainLayout. That's why the pills' active color used to lag until something else
    /// re-rendered the layout (e.g. clicking ASTRO FACTS in the app bar again, 2026-09-28
    /// fix). <see cref="SelectMaster"/> therefore re-hands the rail via
    /// <c>Active.SetHeaderExtra</c>, whose <c>Changed</c> event makes MainLayout re-render and
    /// repaint the pills, and also calls <c>StateHasChanged()</c> for this page's own
    /// <c>@if (_masterTab == N)</c> panels.</summary>
    private static readonly string[] SubLabels =
    {
        "NATAL", "TRANSIT", "BALAS & ASHTAVARGA", "SPL LAGNAS", "YOGAS", "VARGAS",
        "ALL CHARTS", "D1-PROMISE", "PHALITA DASAS", "DASHA MATTERS",
    };

    /// <summary>The rail's pills (2026-10-07, rammyps: merge tabs) — six groups over the ten panels.
    /// Panels, print modules and ?step= links keep their <c>_masterTab</c> indices; a group with
    /// several panels shows them as a second row of pills at the top of the page
    /// (<see cref="GroupNav"/>, labelled by <see cref="SubLabels"/>). A pill lands on its group's
    /// first panel.</summary>
    private static readonly (string Label, int[] Panels)[] Groups =
    {
        ("NATAL", new[] { 0 }),
        ("TRANSIT", new[] { 1 }),
        ("STRENGTH", new[] { 2, 5 }),
        ("READINGS", new[] { 4, 3, 7 }),
        ("DASHAS", new[] { 8, 9 }),
        ("ALL CHARTS", new[] { 6 }),
    };

    private static int GroupOf(int master) => Array.FindIndex(Groups, g => Array.IndexOf(g.Panels, master) >= 0);

    private IReadOnlyList<Ikiastrro.Data.Statistics.MatterPromiseReading>? _promiseReadings;
    private bool _promiseLoaded;
    private string? _promiseError;

    /// <summary>Every life matter's D1 promise (docs/architecture/key_inference_promise.md), read on
    /// first use so the other tabs do not pay for it. Null when the person has no stored D1.</summary>
    private IReadOnlyList<Ikiastrro.Data.Statistics.MatterPromiseReading>? PromiseReadings
    {
        get
        {
            if (_promiseLoaded) return _promiseReadings;
            _promiseLoaded = true;
            try { _promiseReadings = PromiseService.ReadAll(Id, includeVarga: true); }
            catch (Exception ex) { _promiseReadings = null; _promiseError = ex.Message; }
            return _promiseReadings;
        }
    }

    private void SelectMaster(int index)
    {
        if (_masterTab == index) return;
        _masterTab = index;
        Active.SetHeaderExtra(MasterNav); // repaint the rail's pills in MainLayout
        StateHasChanged();
    }

    private RenderFragment MasterNav => @<nav class="ki-master" role="tablist" aria-label="Astro Facts steps">
        @for (var i = 0; i < Groups.Length; i++)
        {
            var group = i;
            var first = Groups[i].Panels[0];
            <button type="button" role="tab" id="@($"ki-tab-{first}")" aria-selected="@(GroupOf(_masterTab) == group)"
                    aria-controls="@($"ki-panel-{first}")" class="ki-steptab" @onclick="() => SelectMaster(GroupOf(_masterTab) == group ? _masterTab : first)">
                @Groups[i].Label
            </button>
        }
    </nav>;

    /// <summary>Second row of pills for a group holding several panels; empty for the rest and when printing.</summary>
    private RenderFragment GroupNav => Printing || Groups[GroupOf(_masterTab)].Panels.Length < 2
        ? @<text></text>
        : @<div class="ki-subnav-wrap">
            <nav class="ki-subnav" role="tablist" aria-label="@($"{Groups[GroupOf(_masterTab)].Label} sections")">
                @foreach (var panel in Groups[GroupOf(_masterTab)].Panels)
                {
                    var index = panel;
                    <button type="button" role="tab" id="@(index == Groups[GroupOf(_masterTab)].Panels[0] ? null : $"ki-tab-{index}")" aria-selected="@(_masterTab == index)"
                            aria-controls="@($"ki-panel-{index}")" class="ki-steptab ki-steptab-sub" @onclick="() => SelectMaster(index)">@SubLabels[index]</button>
                }
            </nav>
        </div>;

    /// <summary>The natal-chart toolbar (collapse/expand + chart picker) + grid, shared by every
    /// master tab that should keep the chart visible on the left (STRENGTH/YOGAS/VARGAS —
    /// rammyps, 2026-09-25) — same collapse state and chart-picker selection as NATAL CHARTS'
    /// own inline copy, so switching tabs doesn't reset either. NATAL CHARTS keeps its own inline
    /// markup (nested inside its `NatalChart is { } natalChart` guard alongside the sub-tabs)
    /// rather than being refactored onto this fragment, to avoid touching already-shipped,
    /// working structure for its own sake. `_natalChart` also now drives (and is driven by,
    /// two-way) AshtakavargaChart's own "Chart" picker in the ASHTAVARGA sub-tab, via
    /// `@bind-SelectedChart` — see that component's `SelectedChart`/`SelectedChartChanged` doc
    /// comment and design-language.md "Related chart drop-downs" (2026-09-25). Any other
    /// component found to carry its own independent copy of "which chart" alongside this rail
    /// should get the same treatment rather than living as a silently out-of-sync duplicate.</summary>
    private RenderFragment ChartColumn => @<div class="ki-gridwrap">
        <div class="ki-chart-toolbar">
            <button type="button" class="ki-chart-toggle" aria-expanded="@(!_natalChartCollapsed)" @onclick="() => _natalChartCollapsed = !_natalChartCollapsed">
